{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790320554006,"sessionID":"ses_f289a069cffe24HWnAQyPvRrCv","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"read_20_3307e457","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/scripts/weapon_manager.gd"},"output":"<path>/workspace/scripts/weapon_manager.gd</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: extends Node3D\n2: \n3: const VIEW_MODEL_SHADER: Shader = preload(\"res://shaders/weapon_clip_and_fov_shader.gdshader\")\n4: \n5: @onready var view_model_container: Node3D = $ViewModel\n6: \n7: func _ready() -> void:\n8: \tapply_clip_and_fov_shader_to_view_model(view_model_container, 54.0)\n9: \n10: ## Recursively finds all MeshInstance3D nodes under `node3d` and replaces each\n11: ## surface material with a ShaderMaterial using the weapon clip & FOV shader.\n12: ## Copies the base material's albedo/metallic/roughness parameters into the\n13: ## shader. If `fov_or_negative_for_unchanged` is >= 0, sets the\n14: ## `viewmodel_fov` shader parameter to that value.\n15: func apply_clip_and_fov_shader_to_view_model(node3d: Node3D, fov_or_negative_for_unchanged := -1.0) -> void:\n16: \tif node3d == null:\n17: \t\treturn\n18: \t_apply_shader_recursive(node3d, fov_or_negative_for_unchanged)\n19: \n20: func _apply_shader_recursive(node: Node, fov: float) -> void:\n21: \tif node is MeshInstance3D:\n22: \t\t_apply_shader_to_mesh_instance(node as MeshInstance3D, fov)\n23: \tfor child in node.get_children():\n24: \t\t_apply_shader_recursive(child, fov)\n25: \n26: func _apply_shader_to_mesh_instance(mesh_instance: MeshInstance3D, fov: float) -> void:\n27: \tif mesh_instance.mesh == null:\n28: \t\treturn\n29: \tvar surface_count := mesh_instance.mesh.get_surface_count()\n30: \tfor surface_idx in surface_count:\n31: \t\tvar base_material := mesh_instance.get_active_material(surface_idx)\n32: \t\tvar shader_material := ShaderMaterial.new()\n33: \t\tshader_material.shader = VIEW_MODEL_SHADER\n34: \n35: \t\t# Copy albedo/metallic/roughness parameters from the base material.\n36: \t\tif base_material is BaseMaterial3D:\n37: \t\t\tshader_material.set_shader_parameter(\"albedo\", (base_material as BaseMaterial3D).albedo_color)\n38: \t\t\tshader_material.set_shader_parameter(\"metallic\", (base_material as BaseMaterial3D).metallic)\n39: \t\t\tshader_material.set_shader_parameter(\"roughness\", (base_material as BaseMaterial3D).roughness)\n40: \t\t\tshader_material.set_shader_parameter(\"specular\", (base_material as BaseMaterial3D).metallic_specular)\n41: \t\t\tshader_material.set_shader_parameter(\"texture_albedo\", (base_material as BaseMaterial3D).albedo_texture)\n42: \t\t\tshader_material.set_shader_parameter(\"texture_metallic\", (base_material as BaseMaterial3D).metallic_texture)\n43: \t\t\tshader_material.set_shader_parameter(\"metallic_texture_channel\", (base_material as BaseMaterial3D).metallic_texture_channel)\n44: \t\t\tshader_material.set_shader_parameter(\"texture_roughness\", (base_material as BaseMaterial3D).roughness_texture)\n45: \t\t\tshader_material.set_shader_parameter(\"texture_normal\", (base_material as BaseMaterial3D).normal_texture)\n46: \t\t\tshader_material.set_shader_parameter(\"normal_scale\", (base_material as BaseMaterial3D).normal_scale)\n47: \t\t\tshader_material.set_shader_parameter(\"uv1_scale\", (base_material as BaseMaterial3D).uv1_scale)\n48: \t\t\tshader_material.set_shader_parameter(\"uv1_offset\", (base_material as BaseMaterial3D).uv1_offset)\n49: \n50: \t\tif fov >= 0.0:\n51: \t\t\tshader_material.set_shader_parameter(\"viewmodel_fov\", fov)\n52: \n53: \t\tmesh_instance.set_surface_override_material(surface_idx, shader_material)\n\n(End of file - total 53 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"extends Node3D\n\nconst VIEW_MODEL_SHADER: Shader = preload(\"res://shaders/weapon_clip_and_fov_shader.gdshader\")\n\n@onready var view_model_container: Node3D = $ViewModel\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tapply_clip_and_fov_shader_to_view_model(view_model_container, 54.0)\n\n## Recursively finds all MeshInstance3D nodes under `node3d` and replaces each\n## surface material with a ShaderMaterial using the weapon clip & FOV shader.\n## Copies the base material's albedo/metallic/roughness parameters into the\n## shader. If `fov_or_negative_for_unchanged` is >= 0, sets the\n## `viewmodel_fov` shader parameter to that value.\nfunc apply_clip_and_fov_shader_to_view_model(node3d: Node3D, fov_or_negative_for_unchanged := -1.0) -> void:\n\tif node3d == null:\n\t\treturn\n\t_apply_shader_recursive(node3d, fov_or_negative_for_unchanged)\n\nfunc _apply_shader_recursive(node: Node, fov: float) -> void:","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/workspace/scripts/weapon_manager.gd","text":"extends Node3D\n\nconst VIEW_MODEL_SHADER: Shader = preload(\"res://shaders/weapon_clip_and_fov_shader.gdshader\")\n\n@onready var view_model_container: Node3D = $ViewModel\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tapply_clip_and_fov_shader_to_view_model(view_model_container, 54.0)\n\n## Recursively finds all MeshInstance3D nodes under `node3d` and replaces each\n## surface material with a ShaderMaterial using the weapon clip & FOV shader.\n## Copies the base material's albedo/metallic/roughness parameters into the\n## shader. If `fov_or_negative_for_unchanged` is >= 0, sets the\n## `viewmodel_fov` shader parameter to that value.\nfunc apply_clip_and_fov_shader_to_view_model(node3d: Node3D, fov_or_negative_for_unchanged := -1.0) -> void:\n\tif node3d == null:\n\t\treturn\n\t_apply_shader_recursive(node3d, fov_or_negative_for_unchanged)\n\nfunc _apply_shader_recursive(node: Node, fov: float) -> void:\n\tif node is MeshInstance3D:\n\t\t_apply_shader_to_mesh_instance(node as MeshInstance3D, fov)\n\tfor child in node.get_children():\n\t\t_apply_shader_recursive(child, fov)\n\nfunc _apply_shader_to_mesh_instance(mesh_instance: MeshInstance3D, fov: float) -> void:\n\tif mesh_instance.mesh == null:\n\t\treturn\n\tvar surface_count := mesh_instance.mesh.get_surface_count()\n\tfor surface_idx in surface_count:\n\t\tvar base_material := mesh_instance.get_active_material(surface_idx)\n\t\tvar shader_material := ShaderMaterial.new()\n\t\tshader_material.shader = VIEW_MODEL_SHADER\n\n\t\t# Copy albedo/metallic/roughness parameters from the base material.\n\t\tif base_material is BaseMaterial3D:\n\t\t\tshader_material.set_shader_parameter(\"albedo\", (base_material as BaseMaterial3D).albedo_color)\n\t\t\tshader_material.set_shader_parameter(\"metallic\", (base_material as BaseMaterial3D).metallic)\n\t\t\tshader_material.set_shader_parameter(\"roughness\", (base_material as BaseMaterial3D).roughness)\n\t\t\tshader_material.set_shader_parameter(\"specular\", (base_material as BaseMaterial3D).metallic_specular)\n\t\t\tshader_material.set_shader_parameter(\"texture_albedo\", (base_material as BaseMaterial3D).albedo_texture)\n\t\t\tshader_material.set_shader_parameter(\"texture_metallic\", (base_material as BaseMaterial3D).metallic_texture)\n\t\t\tshader_material.set_shader_parameter(\"metallic_texture_channel\", (base_material as BaseMaterial3D).metallic_texture_channel)\n\t\t\tshader_material.set_shader_parameter(\"texture_roughness\", (base_material as BaseMaterial3D).roughness_texture)\n\t\t\tshader_material.set_shader_parameter(\"texture_normal\", (base_material as BaseMaterial3D).normal_texture)\n\t\t\tshader_material.set_shader_parameter(\"normal_scale\", (base_material as BaseMaterial3D).normal_scale)\n\t\t\tshader_material.set_shader_parameter(\"uv1_scale\", (base_material as BaseMaterial3D).uv1_scale)\n\t\t\tshader_material.set_shader_parameter(\"uv1_offset\", (base_material as BaseMaterial3D).uv1_offset)\n\n\t\tif fov >= 0.0:\n\t\t\tshader_material.set_shader_parameter(\"viewmodel_fov\", fov)\n\n\t\tmesh_instance.set_surface_override_material(surface_idx, shader_material)","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":53,"totalLines":53,"truncated":false}},"title":"workspace/scripts/weapon_manager.gd","time":{"start":1790320553984,"end":1790320553992}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_read_20_3307e457"}},"id":"prt_0d76baffc001PpYYWYEJ62EFon","sessionID":"ses_f289a069cffe24HWnAQyPvRrCv","messageID":"msg_0d76b82ea001soEGKN5B1cWLTj"}}
